{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0354_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1e3bb3d9ee27b77d92ecf456f71d73b7049ff1983de8fa3962c555ce67279d09", "ja": "（奈緒が新しい衣装を試着している。少し時間が\nかかっている気が……。様子を見に行ってみよう）", "zh": "（奈绪正在试穿新服装。感觉好像花了点时间……去看看情况吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0354_1001_037nao", "source_sha256": "5e32adae5a16b70f2915d24624ec486b1d598e85c08bbb8e00ac5dd44dabb7cf", "ja": "カントリー、カントリー……うーん。\n国？　それとも田舎……？", "zh": "乡村，乡村……嗯——\n是国家？还是农村……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0354_1002_p", "source_sha256": "4406eb4944431ccc4340395eb69455a6511ea0312c52404e31290d64ac0f4d1c", "ja": "奈緒、お疲れさま。\nもしかして、取込み中だったか？", "zh": "奈绪，辛苦了。\n难道说，你正忙着吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0354_1003_037nao", "source_sha256": "61e79ffbb66746b4ab62f19faf7de44ee93cf2e116ee25fe792e4cf816cb2eda", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん、お疲れ様です！\nいえ、大したことやなくて……。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生，辛苦了！\n没什么大不了的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0354_1004_037nao", "source_sha256": "ed79d3ef993faad10b960ec65579f58c3c747cd566702b74c2e504c205c5eaa7", "ja": "『カントリー風』の衣装やって聞いたんです。\nその『カントリー』って、どういう意味なんかなって。", "zh": "说是“乡村风”的服装。\n我就在想，那个“乡村”到底是啥意思呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0354_1005_p", "source_sha256": "bffaa7adc5d59127186c6fb585859ec0cd347429a345174ce36802a83a04d1aa", "ja": "だから、国とか田舎とか呟いてたのか。\n他にも『故郷』って意味があったような……。", "zh": "所以才会嘀咕着“国家”“乡下”之类的啊。好像还带有“故乡”的意思……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0354_1006_037nao", "source_sha256": "810cdcf80bbec2fe156540ea3a6d66bed84c24702147457e5b305d0c40b2a251", "ja": "故郷！　なるほどー。\nつまり、大阪風の衣装ってことですね！", "zh": "故乡！原来如此——\n也就是说，是大阪风格的服装吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0354_1007_p", "source_sha256": "885d267b56afcd16ec8ff7bd3c9d5c6c18b79fc93d07c55866261582ad2e0277", "ja": "お、大阪風か……。うーん、\nこの場合のカントリーはそういう意味じゃ……。", "zh": "哦、大阪风啊……嗯——\n这里的“乡村”不是这个意思……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0354_1008_037nao", "source_sha256": "967793ef0c341e463f47ca1e3b3246305913bd21aa72692285988a377515584e", "ja": "わわっ、冗談です！　説明せんでもわかってます。\nもう、{$P$}さんは真面目やなー。", "zh": "哇哇，开玩笑的啦！不用解释我也明白。真是的，{$P$}先生也太认真了吧——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0354_1009_p", "source_sha256": "317cd7b69a93048ad9ea3936cb08ad9b82dddee19720d38d0cd291f91b2b9351", "ja": "ははっ、そうだな……。", "zh": "哈哈，说得也是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0354_1010_037nao", "source_sha256": "78dbcf62270e7608e9eab03176e69dbdb1256ff8b305d24fc486ca4fba3b8d74", "ja": "ちゃうちゃう！　そこは「ほんまかいな！？」とか\n「なんでやねん！」って、ツッコまんと！", "zh": "不对不对！这时候要吐槽“真的假的！？”或者“搞什么啊！”才对！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0354_1011_p", "source_sha256": "534f13c2f42fa8445084b2c98e8fea0b3f18778c3262dc044d857e1f337d41f6", "ja": "なるほど……。まだまだ修業が足りないみたいだな。\n一流の漫才師になれるように頑張るよ！", "zh": "原来如此……看来我的修行还远远不够啊。\n为了成为一流的漫才师，我会努力的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0354_1012_037nao", "source_sha256": "7dd3075b484758afde78a2695a1a382e2fa5caf90736d58bb2bb0da556437444", "ja": "うむ、期待してるで……って、なんでやねん！\n……おお。今のナイスボケでした。", "zh": "嗯，我期待着呢……不对，干吗呀！  \n……哦哦，刚才这个包袱抖得不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0354_1013_037nao", "source_sha256": "6ad9cccecc6ebb90fb2dae4494c15abebe50a11b6bdc2b4bb1e7b105252807bc", "ja": "てか、{$P$}さんもボケるんですね。\nツッコミのイメージなんで、ちょっと意外でした。", "zh": "话说，{$P$}先生也会说装傻话啊。\n因为一直觉得你是吐槽的那种人，所以有点意外。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0354_1014_p", "source_sha256": "608a138fbfc6e67f90e442d8f25b4dfcb9ab8ad87cfb202d8871c86693b5470c", "ja": "まぁ、たまにはな。それで、試着の様子を\n見にきたんだけど……その大阪風の衣装はどうだ？", "zh": "哎，偶尔也会嘛。然后，我是来看看你试穿得\n怎么样的……那套大阪风格的服装感觉如何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0354_1015_037nao", "source_sha256": "4f777a748e14f29b02bf43cfcb94877870ba56b530669276c8eacb2939b444c7", "ja": "そりゃもう！　め～っちゃ気に入りました♪\nデザインもかわいいですし、最高です！", "zh": "那当然！我超级喜欢的♪\n设计也很可爱，棒极了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0354_1016_037nao", "source_sha256": "e0d72bbf7d6de1c08fcf118d93c91ff9af7dbf1bb91acdceeee98685313add09", "ja": "上京する前、よく地元の古着屋さんに行ってたんです。\nこんな感じの服ようみたなって、思い出しました。", "zh": "来东京之前，我经常去老家那边的二手服装店。\n看到这种感觉的衣服，就想起来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0354_1017_p", "source_sha256": "400d5191141eddb1b8a162143bebb500ba5433973ee6768d511470f179050275", "ja": "なるほどな。なら、大阪風って意味も正解かもな。\n大阪風の衣装……うん、奈緒にピッタリだ！", "zh": "原来如此。那也可以理解为大阪风吧。\n大阪风的服装……嗯，确实很适合奈绪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0354_1018_037nao", "source_sha256": "ab362fcdf26e2cbf36eaffde1e77091ace58aaf399b2c47456c239504dc71d66", "ja": "えへへ、ありがとうございます♪\n……でも、{$P$}さん、一つ問題が。", "zh": "嘿嘿，谢谢你♪\n……不过，{$P$}先生，有一个问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0354_1019_p", "source_sha256": "4cb5a3437b1a28b71b5a2b2d4d28fb81acdd8fa19dc7d44bd61671b467296686", "ja": "ん？　問題？", "zh": "嗯？问题？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0354_1020_037nao", "source_sha256": "e34872b31162429757a49f0a116e7053ff824807a2b5ba719d1595308df59a07", "ja": "地元を思い出したせいで、お口がホームシックです！\nこのままやと、レッスンにも行かれへん……。", "zh": "都怪我想起老家，嘴巴都想家了！\n再这样下去，我都去不了排练了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0354_1021_p", "source_sha256": "76ab4336fd5bae734f35529a74816e1a5731547ccfb29ffc6040ce4104bd0967", "ja": "そ、それは大問題だ！！　よし。\n問題解決のために、お好み焼きでも食べにいくか！", "zh": "那、那可是大问题！！好。为了解决问题，要不要去吃大阪烧之类的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0354_1022_037nao", "source_sha256": "e04168d6e56d18459b1442965e58ce780db3dd04aa82a05f5dbd2e40ff8ec884", "ja": "さすが{$P$}さん、話が早いっ！\nめっちゃおいしいお店があるんで、紹介しますね♪", "zh": "不愧是{$P$}先生，真是爽快！  \n有一家特别好吃的店，我介绍给您吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0354_1023_p", "source_sha256": "1d4da9128b493c8eb61e8b28bf6e8489e983854e3c48a756fb38a6a68e96a654", "ja": "ああ、わかったよ。\nでもその前に、衣装を着替えてからな。", "zh": "啊，知道了。\n不过在那之前，先换好服装。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0354_1024_037nao", "source_sha256": "274a6e3afc46fc2864d42884f0ce43642b90c26addf74520777c3247aa117bc3", "ja": "はーい！　すぐ着替えるんで、待っててください。\n今日はどんなトッピングにしようかな～♪", "zh": "好——！我马上换衣服，请等我一下。\n今天要加什么配料好呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
